221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (The field-creation process was carried out based on the type of information required for each Salesforce object. For the Vehicle object, the Vehicle Model field was created as a Picklist so that users could select the appropriate vehicle category from a predefined list. During the setup, the field type was selected, the field label and API name were provided, and the required picklist values were added. Values such as Sedan, SUV, and EV were included based on the vehicle categories used in the project. This approach makes data entry more consistent and avoids users entering different spellings or formats for the same vehicle type. The same general process was followed while creating the other fields across the Vehicle, Dealer, Customer, Order, Test Drive, and Service Request objects.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
