225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Object relationships were created to connect the different records involved in the dealership process. In the project, Vehicle Orders and Vehicle Test Drives are linked with the corresponding Vehicle and Vehicle Customer records. Similarly, Vehicle Service Requests are connected with the related Vehicle and Customer records. These relationships allow users to access related information easily from a record and help maintain consistency across the application. For example, when viewing an order, the user can identify the customer who placed it and the vehicle selected for the purchase. The relationship fields were created using Salesforce Lookup relationships, and the required field-level security settings were configured during the setup process.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
