/P 140 0 R
/E (Salesforce monitoring tools can be used to identify problems in the application. Important areas include Apex Jobs for monitoring batch or scheduled processing, Debug Logs for investigating unexpected Apex behaviour, Flow Errors for identifying failed automation, and user-access reviews for checking permissions periodically.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
